			],
			"Message": "docs(Land): Enumerate every filesystem path in FilesystemFootprint.md\n\nAdd a comprehensive 574-line document cataloging every host-filesystem location the running editor reads from or writes to, across four ownership domains: the product dotfile root (~/.fiddee/), Tauri-resolved per-bundle Library trees, OS-managed WebKit/SavedState paths, and temp-directory leakage. Includes a write-site index mapping each producer to its filesystem path, a cleanup recipe with shell commands for complete state wipe, lifecycle and growth analysis per session, cross-cutting observations on log multiplicity and two-extension-root layout, and eight encapsulation/versioning directions for future work.\n\nUpdate the README document index to list FilesystemFootprint.md alongside the five existing system architecture documents. Advance the Element submodule to rebuild Cocoon compiled output bundles and RouteManifest timestamp after the previous handler additions — no new RPC methods, ensuring bootstrap and handler bundles are consistent with the regenerated manifest.",
			"SHA": "25ef4d6441127376cbd177b0a5e9b26072a16542"
		},
